{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1789.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"6563e4ddc5cc535823a1145daf4352e6ba0b457d8c85ab1da4c7d54d512865e6","ja":"みんなで挑戦！","zh":"大家一起挑战！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1789.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"540fd87e9b8f0e4956425160c07ee638f28439d9a7234156ed7aedc46e55a8cb","ja":"とある日の劇場公演終わり……","zh":"某天的剧场公演结束后……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1789.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"807b8ab0253684f7a23a9d94a56fd3a763aa0783cad095a21d82616858d64338","ja":"お客さんに喜んでいただけて何よりでしたわね♪\n……あら？　●●●●プロデューサーから連絡が。","zh":"能让客人们开心，真是太好了呢♪  \n……咦？●●●●制作人联系我了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1789.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"75f8eaa748994da7a22a927f5ba3d8e3b04dd0ef4692d7a3247fea5d8609b46d","ja":"あたしにも来たよぉ。えっと……ええ～っ、\nこんなにたくさん、お仕事の話が入ってきたのかい！？","zh":"我这边也收到了哦。呃……诶——，\n竟然来了这么多工作邀约吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1789.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"919ae3ba4fa28ad763d0b176aa7d444382ff27651e2f17616576f92c621b0e7c","ja":"次の劇場公演と同じ日に、「ミニライブ」に\n「トークイベント」、「バラエティ番組」……。","zh":"在下一场剧场公演的同一天，  \n还会有“迷你演唱会”、  \n“谈话活动”、“综艺节目”……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1789.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"11704cd4a0925c962628779d2ef3d1a89df0313ccdaad3aee9241108d2110c8f","ja":"わ、本当にたくさん！　これを一日で……。\nあ、●●●●プロデューサーさんからまた連絡だ。","zh":"哇，真的好多！要在一天之内完成这些……。\n啊，●●●●制作人又联系我了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1789.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"b8be82d59206dc793d2ea2c3980dc8df62326596732fb78cb2761c8becdb7e1b","ja":"えーと……「さすがに全部は請けられないから、\nみんなで話し合って選んでくれ」……だって。","zh":"嗯……他说：“实在没法全部接下来，你们商量一下选吧……”既然这么说。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1789.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"978f5831edc7089754542f862461056ea227e7fb9e3376a8d13655e5dfeb1989","ja":"でもでも、断らなくてもいいんだよね！？\nそれじゃあ私、全部やってみたいな～！","zh":"不过不过，不用拒绝也可以吧！？\n那我想全部试试看～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1789.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"98d163f017f96109417b8f6d64c02d466fd5780447c2ebfb04832a65838e918a","ja":"またそんな無茶言って。BOTがきっかけで\n依頼が殺到してるんでしょ？　なら焦らなくても……。","zh":"又说这种强人所难的话。你看，不就是因为BOT，委托才蜂拥而至的吗？那也不用着急……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1789.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"70ff81d85b51d7c8867cc51f82c6040697aade1a2d4e5a4346a7d83f640da2f7","ja":"それならなおさら全部やりたいよ！　BOTを見て、\n私たちにやってほしいって、思ってくれたんだもん！","zh":"既然这样，那我就更想全部做一遍了！毕竟你看了BOT，觉得想让我们来做嘛！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1789.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"2fc84c17816d94d2983cb613405416df9c1dd1d478e35633581807558b92366d","ja":"それに、なんだか後夜祭みたいかもって。\n絶対楽しいよ！","zh":"而且，感觉有点像庆功会呢。\n绝对会很开心的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1789.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"a0a0cdc3fd83a8abd4ef72d230a45ce67c34f5a33a3e6cdf66cc6de93e4bd74f","ja":"あ、そう言われたら楽しそう！\nみんなでお祭り～♪　お仕事たっぷり～♪","zh":"啊，你这么一说，感觉好像会很开心！\n大家一起去庆典～♪　工作满满～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1789.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"468d0984da12d2feb9da1364b59c9314d8aff7d93fd65a6cd29f48f74518931d","ja":"あたしもやってみたいなぁ。BOTが終わって、\nちょっこし、寂しい気持ちもあったからねぇ。","zh":"我也想试试看呀。BOT结束后，我也稍微有点寂寞呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1789.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"2244cd78b8f972001ae0a68c125eca08afba4526eee6cbd220144c9ba2b704a0","ja":"それに、期待にはできる限り応えたいですわね。\n時間をやりくりすることさえできれば……。","zh":"而且，我也想尽可能回应期待呢。  \n只要能设法安排好时间……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1789.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"af338a11636524d2f78cece081c71a192924ef6920e4a3132346cda6284fbf8f","ja":"それじゃあ、グループ分けするのはどうかしら？\n手分けして別々のお仕事に行くの。","zh":"那么，分组行动怎么样？\n分头去做不同的工作。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1789.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"09c6b848b501acb49207d4ea77abc1cf1c7e69b6ea06cf24a2704fd487af5f45","ja":"もちろん、先方にも、\nそれでいいか確認を取る必要はあるけど。","zh":"当然，也需要向对方确认这样是否可以。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1789.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"c4cddd55146f4713f46b5ef2615952b114b9d459e9804a5b3df3e91133b2ddef","ja":"確かに、分かれたら、\r\n何とかなるかもしれませんね……。","zh":"确实，分开的话，说不定就能解决了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1789.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"983afcc99a5896c06fb2345ebb0818a3e66b3f5a4ea2f6931d001d669e856bd5","ja":"けど、やるからにはどの仕事も完璧にこなさないと。\nどうすればいいか、しっかり考えましょう。","zh":"既然要做，就必须把每项工作都完美完成。\n好好想想该怎么做吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1789.unity3d","item_key":"commands[49].text","source_sha256":"a585d3a257e4d507c6bcb6fd71f66b3a3038de4506ac483a3a0fcd67c2eafb80","ja":"やった～っ♪　じゃあ、どのお仕事に行きたい？\n私はね……。","zh":"太好了～♪ 那么，你想去做哪份工作？\n我嘛……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
